        "opening_words": "Picture two people opening brokerage\naccounts on the exact same Tuesday in\n2018. Same age, same job, same $3,000\nsitting in checking, same decision, put\nsome of it somewhere it could grow. Then\nthey went in completely different\ndirections. One spent the next seven\nyears chasing everything the market had\nto offer, meme stocks, crypto, hot tips,\nevery headline promising the next big\nopportunity. Every win felt exciting,\nevery loss felt like something to fix.\nThe other clicked automatic transfer,\np",
